#: apps/accounts/forms.py:296
msgid ""
"Shows a dashboard card nudging you to log a body measurement when you "
"haven't logged one in a while. Turn off to never see that reminder — you can "
"still log a reading any time from Body tracking."
msgstr ""
"Shows a dashboard card nudging you to log a body measurement when you "
"haven't logged one in a while. Turn off to never see that reminder — you can "
"still log a reading any time from Body tracking."

